    // it State becomes 1 (takeoff time). Live 0.109 .. 0.32. | Name: Toolkit
    // eoc::jump::helpers::SetupJumpInitialState (EoCShared.dll+0x133EAE0, same offsets as bg3.exe:
    // Time +0x10, State +0xC) stores
